.start-failed.title":"无法连接","pages.connectors-oauth-error.title":"无法授权应用","pages.connectors-oauth-error.try-again":"重试","pages.connectors-oauth-success.close":"关闭窗口","pages.connectors-oauth-success.description":"您的帐户现已关联。您可以关闭此窗口并返回 Grok。","pages.connectors-oauth-success.title":"已连接","pages.forbidden-business.description":"此功能被您的组织禁用。请联系您的管理员了解更多信息。","pages.forbidden-business.home":"返回首页","pages.forbidden-business.title":"访问已拒绝","pages.network-blocked.cta":"登出","pages.network-blocked.description":"你的组织将此网络上的 Grok 使用权限限制为仅组织成员可用。你当前登录的是个人账户。请退出登录，并使用你的组织账户登录。","pages.network-blocked.title":"访问受限","pages.no-license.description":"您是一个不允许个人工作区的组织的成员，但您尚未被分配 {{productName}} 许可证。请联系您的管理员以分配许可证。","pages.no-license.title":"许可证缺失","personality.comprehensive.description":"以详细的解释回应。","personality.comprehensive.name":"全面","personality.concise.description":"提供简短直接的回应。","personality.concise.name":"简洁模式","personality.formal.description":"使用正式语气回应。","personality.formal.name":"正式模式","personality.socratic.description":"以引导学习的方式回应。","personality.socratic.name":"苏格拉底模式","personality.tutor.description":"以引导学习的方式回应。","personality.tutor.name":"导师","plugins-page-title":"插件","private-conversation-blurb":"此聊天不会出现在你的历史记录中，也不会用于模型训练。","private-conversation-blurb-team":"此聊天将不会出现在您的历史记录中。","privilege.dropdown.label":"Privilege","privilege.edit-v2":"编辑器","privilege.no-access":"无访问权限","privilege.read-v2":"查看器","privilege.remove-access":"移除权限","project-chip.open":"打开项目","project-new-chat-error.toast":"无法开始新聊天","project-source-chip.dismiss.label":"离开项目","project-source-chip.source-link.label":"打开源文件夹","publish-verified-skill-dialog-title":"发布 \\"{{name}}\\"","publish-verified-skill-remove":"移除","publish-verified-skill-update-failed":"更新发布失败","query-bar.attach-popover.attach":"附件","query-bar.attach-popover.close":"关闭","query-bar.attachments":"对话附件","query-bar.attachments-failed":"文件上传失败。移除或重试失败的文件，然后再试。","query-bar.connectors-add":"添加连接器","query-bar.connectors-manage":"管理连接器","query-bar.connectors-re